OL,3,GNEWSAHusband appears in court accused
OL,4,Aof GP's murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe husband of a GP has appeared in
OL,7,Fcourt charged with her murder after she
OL,8,Fwas found dead at home.
OL,10,FThe body of 45-year-old GP Dr Hannah
OL,11,FTerry, also known as Hannah Cain, was
OL,12,Ffound at a property in Fern Hill in
OL,13,FDersingham, Norfolk, on Sunday.
OL,15,FMark Cain, 45, also of Fern Hill, was
OL,16,Fcharged with her murder on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
