OL,3,GNEWSAHusband appears in court accused
OL,4,Aof GP's murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe appeared in a black sweatshirt at
OL,7,FNorwich Magistrates' Court, where he
OL,8,Fspoke only to confirm his age, name and
OL,9,Faddress. He was not asked to enter a
OL,10,Fplea and is due back in court on
OL,11,FThursday.
